{
    "title": "Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960",
    "description": "Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 in Spanish\r\nBible Concordance, Bible Dictionary, Audio, Daily Readings, Offline and much more!\r\n\r\nFor more than fifty years, the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 has become the Bible of greater acceptance and trust for millions of Spanish-speaking evangelical Christians around the world.\r\n\r\n\u2606 Bible Concordance\r\nIn this Concordance you will find an alphabetical index of all the biblical words. You can also search by several words - use the space between them\r\n\r\n\u2606 Bible Dictionary\r\nIn this Dictionary you will find thousands of words with reference to the verses of the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960. It will be a great help in your Study of the Bible!\r\n\r\n\u2606 Readings Plans\r\nCanonical, Chronological and Historical for 1 year, 180 and 60 days.\r\n\r\n\u2606 Daily Verses\r\nDaily Gospel, Psalms - you can create your own daily verse!\r\n\r\n\u2606 Audio Bible\r\nThe audio works Offline and even when the application is closed!\r\n\r\n\u2606 Design\r\nGood quality design with nice colors and easy navigation. Night mode helps your eyes when you read in the dark\r\n\r\n\u2606 Notes / Bookmarks / Highlights\r\nSimply touch the verse or select any part of the text. You can create your own folders to facilitate your study of the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960!\r\n\r\n\u2606 Synchronization\r\nQuick and easy way to save all your activity and use the app on several devices\r\n\r\n\u2606 Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 in Spanish\r\nThis version has retained the traditional style of Spanish as well as a high level of biblical scholarship.\r\n\r\n\u2606 Search\r\nQuick and intelligent search helps you find any Bible verse!\r\n\r\n\u2606 Offline and Free Full\r\nAll the features of this app are absolutely free and it works completely offline!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 in Spanish<br>Bible Concordance, Bible Dictionary, Audio, Daily Readings, Offline and much more!<br><br>For more than fifty years, the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 has become the Bible of greater acceptance and trust for millions of Spanish-speaking evangelical Christians around the world.<br><br>\u2606 Bible Concordance<br>In this Concordance you will find an alphabetical index of all the biblical words. You can also search by several words - use the space between them<br><br>\u2606 Bible Dictionary<br>In this Dictionary you will find thousands of words with reference to the verses of the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960. It will be a great help in your Study of the Bible!<br><br>\u2606 Readings Plans<br>Canonical, Chronological and Historical for 1 year, 180 and 60 days.<br><br>\u2606 Daily Verses<br>Daily Gospel, Psalms - you can create your own daily verse!<br><br>\u2606 Audio Bible<br>The audio works Offline and even when the application is closed!<br><br>\u2606 Design<br>Good quality design with nice colors and easy navigation. Night mode helps your eyes when you read in the dark<br><br>\u2606 Notes / Bookmarks / Highlights<br>Simply touch the verse or select any part of the text. You can create your own folders to facilitate your study of the Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960!<br><br>\u2606 Synchronization<br>Quick and easy way to save all your activity and use the app on several devices<br><br>\u2606 Holy Bible Reina Valera 1960 in Spanish<br>This version has retained the traditional style of Spanish as well as a high level of biblical scholarship.<br><br>\u2606 Search<br>Quick and intelligent search helps you find any Bible verse!<br><br>\u2606 Offline and Free Full<br>All the features of this app are absolutely free and it works completely offline!",
